  "notes": "{実在|じつざい} combines {実|じつ} (actual, real) and {在|ざい} (existence). It can function as a noun or as a suru verb ({実在|じつざい}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {実在|じつざい}の{人物|じんぶつ} (real person)\n- {実在|じつざい}する{場所|ばしょ} (real place)\n- {実在|じつざい}が{確認|かくにん}される (existence is confirmed)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {存在|そんざい} is the general word for existence, while {実在|じつざい} specifically emphasizes being real as opposed to fictional or imaginary.",
